  "prefLabel": "He-P 4034.04 Exemptions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4034.04 Exemptions. Upon application of any interested person or its own initiative, DHHS/RHS shall grant an exemption from the requirements of the regulations in this part if it determines the exemption is authorized by law and would not endanger life or property or the common defense and security and is otherwise in the public interest.\n\nSource. #6942, eff 2-1-99; ss by #8800, INTERIM, eff 2-1-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-07\n\nNew. #8959, eff 8-7-07; ss by #10983, eff 11-24-15; ss by #14325, eff 7-19-25, EXPIRES: 7-19-35",
